{
  "title": "Salawat upon Imam al-Baqir (a.s.)",
  "data": "اَللّٰهُمَّ صَلِّ عَلٰى مُحَمَّدِ بْنِ عَلِيٍّ بَاقِرِ الْعِلْمِ\nALLAAHUMMA SALLI A'LAA MUHAMMADIBNI A'LIYYIN BAAQIRIL I'LM\nO Allah, (please) send blessings upon Muhammad the son of Ali, the splitter of knowledge,\nوَاِمَامِ الْهُدٰى وَقَاۤئِدِ اَهْلِ التَّقْوٰى\nWA IMAAMIL HUDAA WA QAA'IDI AHLIT TAQWAA\nthe leader to true guidance, the chief of the people of piety,\nوَالْمُنْتَجَبِ مِنْ عِبَادِكَ\nWAL MUNTAJABI MIN I'BAADIK\nand the superbly selected from among Your servants.\nاَللّٰهُمَّ وَكَمَا جَعَلْتَهٗ عَلَمًا لِعِبَادِكَ\nALLAAHUMMA WA KAMAA JA'ALTAHOO A'LAMAN LI-I'BAADIK\nO Allah, as You have made him a sign for Your servants,\nوَمَنَارًا لِبِلَادِكَ\nWA MANAARAN LIBILAADIK\na lantern in Your lands,\nوَمُسْتَوْدَعًا لِحِكْمَتِكَ\nWA MUSTAWDA'AN LIHIKMATIK\na depository of Your wisdom,\nوَمُتَرْجِمًا لِوَحْيِكَ\nWA MUTARJIMAN LIWAHYIK\nand an interpreter of Your revelations,\nوَاَمَرْتَ بِطَاعَتِهٖ وَحَذَّرْتَ مِنْ مَعْصِيَتِهٖ\nWA AMARTA BITAA'ATIHEE WA HADHDHARTA MIN MA'SIYATIH\nand You ordered (us) to obey him and warned (us) against disobeying him;\nفَصَلِّ عَلَيْهِ يَا رَبِّ\nFASALLI A'LAYHI YAA RABB\nso also (please), O Lord, send blessings upon him\nاَفْضَلَ مَا صَلَّيْتَ عَلٰىۤ اَحَدٍ مِنْ ذُرِّيَّةِ اَنْبِيَاۤئِكَ\nAFDALA MAA SALLAYTA A'LAA AHADIM MIN DHURRIYYATI ANBIYAA'IK\nwith the most excellent blessings that You have ever sent upon any of the offspring of Your Prophets,\nوَاَصْفِيَاۤئِكَ وَرُسُلِكَ وَاُمَنَاۤئِكَ\nWA ASFIYAA'IKA WA RUSULIKA WA UMANAA'IK\nElite Ones, Messengers, and trustees.\nيَا رَبَّ الْعَالَمِيْنَ\nYAA RABBAL A'ALAMEEN\nO Lord of the worlds!",
  "merits": "Among the recommended rites of Fridays, Shaykh al-Tusi, in Misbah al-Mutahajjid, records an invocation of blessings upon the Holy Prophet (s.a.w.a.), Lady Fatimah (s.a.) and each of the Imams (a.s.) in turn, reported from Imam al-Hasan al-'Askari (a.s.). This is its part upon Imam al-Baqir (a.s.)."
}
